{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"One of the many pieces of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/paper\" title=\"paper\">paper</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bind\" title=\"bind\">bound</a> together within a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/book\" title=\"book\">book</a> or similar document.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The book which he was reading had 213 <b>pages</b>."},{"example":"The graph is on <b>page</b> 30, but I opened the textbook at <b>page</b> 32."}],"examples":["The book which he was reading had 213 <b>pages</b>.","The graph is on <b>page</b> 30, but I opened the textbook at <b>page</b> 32."]},{"definition":"One side of a paper <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/leaf\" title=\"leaf\">leaf</a> in a bound document."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt19\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/collective\" title=\"collective\">collective</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/memory\" title=\"memory\">memory</a>; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/noteworthy\" title=\"noteworthy\">noteworthy</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/event\" title=\"event\">event</a>; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/memorable\" title=\"memorable\">memorable</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/episode\" title=\"episode\">episode</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"a <b>page</b> from history"}],"examples":["a <b>page</b> from history"]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt21\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/type\" title=\"type\">type</a> set up for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/print\" title=\"print\">printing</a> a page."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt22\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/screenful\" title=\"screenful\">screenful</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/text\" title=\"text\">text</a> and possibly other content; especially, the digital simulation of one side of a paper leaf."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt25\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/web_page\" title=\"web page\">web page</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt27\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/block\" title=\"block\">block</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/contiguous\" title=\"contiguous\">contiguous</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/memory\" title=\"memory\">memory</a> of a fixed <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/length\" title=\"length\">length</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt28\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt29\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#clipping\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">Clipping</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/memory_page#English:_virtual_memory\" title=\"memory page\">memory page</a></i></span></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:English_clippings#PAGE\" about=\"#mwt29\">."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt53\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mark\" title=\"mark\">mark</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/number\" title=\"number\">number</a> the pages of, as a book or manuscript."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt55\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/turn\" title=\"turn\">turn</a> several pages of a publication.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The patient <b>paged</b> through magazines while he waited for the doctor."}],"examples":["The patient <b>paged</b> through magazines while he waited for the doctor."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt57\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/furnish\" title=\"furnish\">furnish</a> with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/folio\" title=\"folio\">folios</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt74\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/serve\" title=\"serve\">serving</a> boy; a youth attending a person of high degree, especially at <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/court\" title=\"court\">courts</a>, often as a position of honor and education."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt76\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/youth\" title=\"youth\">youth</a> employed for doing <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/errand\" title=\"errand\">errands</a>, waiting on the door, and similar service in households."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt77\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/boy\" title=\"boy\">boy</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/girl\" title=\"girl\">girl</a> employed to wait upon the members of a legislative body."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt78\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/employee\" title=\"employee\">employee</a> whose main purpose is to replace materials that have either been <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/checked_out\" title=\"checked out\">checked out</a> or otherwise moved, back to their shelves."},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/contrivance\" title=\"contrivance\">contrivance</a>, such as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/band\" title=\"band\">band</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pin\" title=\"pin\">pin</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/snap\" title=\"snap\">snap</a>, or the like, to hold the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/skirt\" title=\"skirt\">skirt</a> of a woman’s dress from the ground."},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/track\" title=\"track\">track</a> along which <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pallet\" title=\"pallet\">pallets</a> carrying newly molded <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/brick\" title=\"brick\">bricks</a> are conveyed to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hack\" title=\"hack\">hack</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt79\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/message\" title=\"message\">message</a> sent to someone's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pager\" title=\"pager\">pager</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt82\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Any one of several species of colorful South American <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/moth\" title=\"moth\">moths</a> of the genus <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Urania\" title=\"Urania\">Urania</a></i>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"<span class=\"maintenance-line\" about=\"#mwt83\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(Can we add an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Example_sentences\" title=\"Wiktionary:Example sentences\">example</a> for this sense?)</span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Requests_for_example_sentences_in_English#PAGE\" about=\"#mwt83\">"}],"examples":["<span class=\"maintenance-line\" about=\"#mwt83\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(Can we add an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:Example_sentences\" title=\"Wiktionary:Example sentences\">example</a> for this sense?)</span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Requests_for_example_sentences_in_English#PAGE\" about=\"#mwt83\">"]}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt96\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/attend\" title=\"attend\">attend</a> (someone) as a page."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt98\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/call\" title=\"call\">call</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/summon\" title=\"summon\">summon</a> (someone).<!--is this different from the def below?-->"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt99\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/contact\" title=\"contact\">contact</a> (someone) by means of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pager\" title=\"pager\">pager</a> or other <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mobile\" title=\"mobile\">mobile</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/device\" title=\"device\">device</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"I'll be out all day, so <b>page</b> me if you need me."}],"examples":["I'll be out all day, so <b>page</b> me if you need me."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt102\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/call\" title=\"call\">call</a> (somebody) using a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/public_address_system\" title=\"public address system\">public address system</a> to find them.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"An SUV parked me in. Could you please <b>page</b> its owner<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"}],"examples":["An SUV parked me in. Could you please <b>page</b> its owner<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"]}]}],"nl":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Dutch","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt129\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/page#Noun_2\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">page</a> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt130\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt1